```

The `kv_crc` value inside v2 resume tokens is computed as a cyclic redundancy check (CRC) of the serialized key-value (KV) pair inside the resume token. The CRC algorithm used is the 32-bit CRC with a reflect-in-bit polynomial (CRC-32/IEEE). The CRC value is appended to the serialized KV pair inside the resume token, and the resulting concatenated string is Base64-encoded to produce the final v2 resume token.
